Error: Jet.UnusedPlaceMark: Write `^^title` instead of `title.move()` for a `^^` parameter
  --> Tests/UI/e0225_call_mark_move_method_arg.jet:5:19
    |
  5 |     print(archive(title.move()))
    |                   ^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `archive: fn(title: ^^String)` takes this input, and a call into a `^^` parameter spells a whole-name move as `^^title` (or plain `title`), not `title.move()`
 Fix: Write `^^title`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.UnusedPlaceMark
